🍼 Baby Tracker Activity Mapping

Button	GPIO	Action
Blue	12	    Feed Start
Red	    19	    Sleep Start
Green	27	    Pee → +1 pee, +1 diaper
Yellow	21	    Poo → +1 poo, +1 diaper
Black	33	    Stop
Combo	12+21	Clear all logs (Blue + Yellow)
Combo   27+21   +1 pee, +1 poo, +1 diaper (Green + Yellow)
Combo   33+12   Stop feeding
Combo   33+19   Stop sleeping